rren Buffett's advice and as my  wife's alarm went off I went closer to  her and just touched her and hugged her  and wished her good morning and just  wanted to show some extra love towards  her  I got up I made her her breakfast of the  day and got her the vitamin water that  that I usually drink in the morning and  stood by the door she drove off to work  and I felt so much more love for her and  just wanted her to feel loved in return  and wanted her to have a loving start to  the day and I felt in that moment man  Warren Buffett's advice you know it  really hit me and it really impacted my  morning and I felt like you know the  point of this morning series was to  share things were having an impact on my  life and since this had a big impact on  my morning I thought I was gonna share  it with you now the more I thought about  it I also realized that this could  really have an impact on your business  you should love and show love to your  team into your customers into the  community that you work in now may not  be the unconditional love that Warren  Buffett is talking about I don't expect  you to love your staff as much as you  may love your children or your husband  or wife but showing them love and having  them know that even if they make  mistakes you've got their back can go a  long way to helping them be confident  and build great things for your business  and I think about why I'm doing these  videos and why I started the channel and  the love that I have for you guys and  wanting to see your businesses take off  and your day go amazingly well so today  I just wanted to spread some love and I  hope you guys will have a love filled  day and spread love to others as well  I'd love to know what you think about  Warren Buffett and his advice if you  want to leave a comment below I'm gonna  be joining in the discussion and look  forward to seeing you there of course  remember to believe have a great day and  I'll see you soon
 

